          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Musa odwoko ni, “Meno ibino miyo wan ogwaŋe ma miyo cowirok, kodi cowirok awaŋa ri Rwoth Were mawan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be, waripo kadho g'ogwaŋe mawan m'ongoye m'odoŋ cen. Wan wegi waripo yero ogwaŋe ma lamo gine Rwoth Were mawan. Aka cuka watundo kenyo, wakibino ŋeyo ogwaŋe mene ma miyo go.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
